vine 1.2.0
prefix: mcp
title: scry over MCP
---
[root] scry over MCP (complete)
The second delivery stage: expose the completed scry library through a caller
facing MCP stdio process. A separate human-facing command remains unplanned.
Each node records the boundary it owns and the check that made it true.
This graph ends at process-level MCP validation. VS Code host registration and
Chat invocation are separate lifecycle stages documented in lifecycle.md.
-> e2e
@guidance text/markdown human-authored-specs/mcp.md
